-- #2768. r1/r2 are an unsignatured mutually recursive pair that inherits its `Num a =>`
-- constraint through a call to l0, a promoted non-member of the group. check accepts and
-- run prints the correct 6; the native binary segfaults on the exact same program. See
-- claim.txt.
import lib.{r1}

main = println (r1 (3 : Int))
